{
  "family": "false-covers",
  "note": "What is no cover: a target's own parts (a button's text, a text field's floating label and its scroll bar: own-parts), a toolbar over the keyboard dismissal the cell's config taps (toolbar-dismiss: a screen-sized one, layer toolbar-screen; toolbar-dismiss-bar: an itemless bar-sized one, layer toolbar-bar; toolbar-dismiss-short: the screen-sized one over a form whose scroll view is shorter than the screen, its frame over the title, layer toolbar-screen-short — #7's second fix) — phase 3 B5 (calibration.json: #7, #8, #18, #19). App files: AveriLab/FalseCovers.swift, FalseCovers.kt (own-parts only: the toolbar cells are form cells, phase 2b on Android).",
